    {
      "documentId": "document:sanguozhi-c91d447aca4b83dc",
      "query": "呂蒙",
      "count": 6,
      "offset": 1030,
      "excerpt": "山寇復動。還過豫章，使呂範平鄱陽，（會稽）程普討樂安。太史慈領海昏，韓當、周泰、呂蒙等爲劇縣令長。\n\n　　九年，權弟丹楊太守翊爲左右所害，以從兄瑜代翊。〔吳錄曰：是時權大會官寮，沈友有所是非，令人扶出，謂曰：「人言卿欲反。」友知不得脫，乃曰：「",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "三國志/卷47",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B747",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2602668",
      "textSha256": "b0881225cae2352449bdffebae5071db213a1c80dddc87a53b0b8009252e33c7",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/sanguozhi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:sanguozhi-4cb59bac27ca5ef7",
      "query": "呂蒙",
      "count": 2,
      "offset": 18253,
      "excerpt": "聲而響臻，志士希光而影騖，異人輻湊，猛士如林。於是張昭爲師傅，周瑜、陸公、魯肅、呂蒙之疇入爲腹心，出作股肱；甘寧、淩統、程普、賀齊、朱桓、朱然之徒奮其威，韓當、潘璋、黃蓋、蔣欽、周泰之屬宣其力；風雅則諸葛瑾、張承、步隲以聲名光國，政事則顧雍、潘",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "三國志/卷48",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B748",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2085142",
      "textSha256": "77c7079632db0fd7e6a8ade6b75027b14edd77603ef7c87d88be56bb6fd8c077",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/sanguozhi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:sanguozhi-c99ac094ed9e3be3",
      "query": "呂蒙",
      "count": 2,
      "offset": 1268,
      "excerpt": "，揚威於北境。非徒相使逞私志而已。近聞卿與甘興霸飲，因酒發作，侵陵其人，其人求屬呂蒙督中。此人雖粗豪，有不如人意時，然其較略大丈夫也。吾親之者，非私之也。我親愛之，卿疏憎之。卿所為每與吾違，其可久乎？夫居敬而行簡，可以臨民；愛人多容，可以得眾。",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "三國志/卷51",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B751",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2457446",
      "textSha256": "998f078db6985d77f4224ae50ecfdc0395dcbf786eaafbe0948ee1836de93d78",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/sanguozhi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:sanguozhi-d564e5035376167d",
      "query": "呂蒙",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 8383,
      "excerpt": "。\"權聞之愴然，乃曰：\"特爲君赦之。\"\n\n　　後從討關羽，封宣城侯，以綏南將軍代呂蒙領南郡太守，住公安。劉備東伐呉，呉王求和，瑾與備箋曰：\"奄聞旗鼓來至白帝，或恐議臣以呉王侵取此州，危害關羽，怨深禍大，不宜答和，此用心於小，末留意於大者也。試爲",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "三國志/卷52",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B752",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2085149",
      "textSha256": "564f827aa5bd0e787465a468b34168de63f6456bdeeb95527c3dfb3561ea8014",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/sanguozhi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:sanguozhi-8976dc43bfbdacb8",
      "query": "呂蒙",
      "count": 8,
      "offset": 3069,
      "excerpt": "必走。」瑜以二千人益之。〕瑜即遣甘寧前據夷陵。仁分兵騎別攻圍寧。寧告急於瑜。瑜用呂蒙計，留淩統以守其後，身與蒙上救寧。寧圍既解，乃渡屯北岸，剋期大戰。瑜親跨馬擽陳，會流矢中右脅，瘡甚，便還。後仁聞瑜臥未起，勒兵就陳。瑜乃自興，案行軍營，激揚吏士",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "三國志/卷54",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B754",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2387393",
      "textSha256": "75392daccee2464ac37c77c892826c4726311a29fbc62b912a52ce402e138cd4",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/sanguozhi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:sanguozhi-ba0f67a715c3f0df",
      "query": "呂蒙",
      "count": 11,
      "offset": 1513,
      "excerpt": "從征劉勳，破黃祖，還討鄱陽，領樂安長，山越畏服。後以中郎將與周瑜等拒破曹公，又與呂蒙襲取南郡，遷偏將軍，領永昌太守。宜都之役，與陸遜、朱然等共攻蜀軍於涿鄉，大破之，徙威烈將軍，封都亭侯。曹真攻南郡，當保東南。在外爲帥，厲將士同心固守，又敬望督司",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "三國志/卷55",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B755",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2603286",
      "textSha256": "1c8a8780581e9b7449a6ab6961363713138c524327b835659e2eb8e46419a897",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/sanguozhi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:sanguozhi-0dc54e1e3ce59b61",
      "query": "呂蒙",
      "count": 2,
      "offset": 1582,
      "excerpt": "二十四年，從討關羽，別與潘璋到臨沮禽羽，遷昭武將軍，封西安鄉侯。\n\n　　虎威將軍呂蒙病篤。權問曰：「卿如不起，誰可代者?」蒙對曰：「朱然膽守有餘，愚以為可任。」蒙卒，權假然節，鎮江陵。黃武元年，劉備舉兵攻宜都。然督五千人與陸遜並力拒備。然別攻破",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "三國志/卷56",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B756",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2627183",
      "textSha256": "47efee59f28992df7e8c33d8d1b4e563dd151795085f65e164126be931fe5d21",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/sanguozhi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:sanguozhi-e5932860eb5f42f7",
      "query": "呂蒙",
      "count": 2,
      "offset": 2087,
      "excerpt": "　　孫權以為騎都尉。翻數犯顏諫爭，權不能悅。又性不協俗，多見謗毀，坐徙丹楊涇縣。呂蒙圖取關羽，稱疾還建業，以翻兼知醫術，請以自隨，亦欲因此令翻得釋也。後蒙舉軍西上，南郡太守麋芳開城出降。蒙未據郡城而作樂沙上。翻渭蒙曰：“今區區一心者麋將軍也，城",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "三國志/卷57",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B757",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2638131",
      "textSha256": "7e7f5d6d9d250c3e23937a46c24789667a37337e707ae27437330f02e0ad9f7c",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/sanguozhi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:sanguozhi-866554b6f92a3aae",
      "query": "呂蒙",
      "count": 2,
      "offset": 636,
      "excerpt": "是以白遜。若遜復毀式以亂聖聽，不可長也。」權曰：「此誠長者之事，顧人不能為耳。」呂蒙稱疾詣建業，遜往見之。謂曰：「關羽接境，如何遠下，後不當可憂也？」蒙曰：「誠如來言，然我病篤。」遜曰：「羽矜其驍氣，陵轢於人。始有大功，意驕志逸，但務北進，未嫌",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "三國志/卷58",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B758",
